8. Summary
This backend design organizes the Field Service Management System into a clean, scalable architecture with separated layers, strong role-based authorization, structured database relationships, and clearly defined APIs. It supports the full service lifecycle: request creation, technician assignment, work execution, payment processing, and customer feedback, while ensuring a reliable and maintainable backend foundation for future growth.
